{"id":"dbb2975ac51ab458","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-kolm-uncomp.md","title":"Incomputability of C and K","display":"thm-kolm-uncomp — Incomputability of C and K","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-kolm-uncomp","aliases":["43-thm-kolm-uncomp"],"display":"thm-kolm-uncomp — Incomputability of C and K","depends_on":["[[43-df-kolm]]","[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-df-pair-coding]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"§6.1 and §6.5; Berry-style diagonal argument","source_printed_pages":"87–99","source_pdf_pages":"107–119","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-kolm-uncomp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-kolm-uncomp</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kolm-uncomp — Incomputability of C and K"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" href=\"?note=a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" title=\"43-df-kolm\">43-df-kolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e039afac1517f3d7\" href=\"?note=e039afac1517f3d7\" title=\"43-df-pair-coding\">43-df-pair-coding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§6.1 and §6.5; Berry-style diagonal argument"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"87–99"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"107–119"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,K:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(C,K:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>，分别为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" href=\"?note=a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" title=\"43-df-kolm\">43-df-kolm</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a> 在有限二进制串域上的函数分支；自然数参数按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e039afac1517f3d7\" href=\"?note=e039afac1517f3d7\" title=\"43-df-pair-coding\">43-df-pair-coding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}\\)</span> 编码。 部分可计算性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Computable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Computable}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a> 的同名符号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{Computable}(C)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Computable}(K).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\mathrm{Computable}(C)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Computable}(K).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若复杂度函数可计算，给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 可搜索首个复杂度大于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的串。该串可由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 有效生成，故复杂度至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(n)+O(1)\">\\(C(n)+O(1)\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K(n)+O(1)=O(\\log n)\">\\(K(n)+O(1)=O(\\log n)\\)</span>，与大于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 矛盾。复杂度无界由有限程序计数保证。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，§6.1 and §6.5; Berry-style diagonal argument；印刷页 87–99，PDF 页 107–119。本次逐项核对陈述；下文给出笔记内论证，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-kolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pair-coding","status":"resolved","id":"e039afac1517f3d7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-pair-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $C,K:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbb N$，分别为 [[43-df-kolm]]、[[43-df-prefixkolm]] 在有限二进制串域上的函数分支；自然数参数按 [[43-df-pair-coding]] 的 $\\operatorname{bin}$ 编码。 部分可计算性见 [[43-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $C,K:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbb N$，分别为 [[43-df-kolm]]、[[43-df-prefixkolm]] 在有限二进制串域上的函数分支；自然数参数按 [[43-df-pair-coding]] 的 $\\operatorname{bin}$ 编码。 部分可计算性见 [[43-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pair-coding","status":"resolved","id":"e039afac1517f3d7","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $C,K:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbb N$，分别为 [[43-df-kolm]]、[[43-df-prefixkolm]] 在有限二进制串域上的函数分支；自然数参数按 [[43-df-pair-coding]] 的 $\\operatorname{bin}$ 编码。 部分可计算性见 [[43-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $C,K:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbb N$，分别为 [[43-df-kolm]]、[[43-df-prefixkolm]] 在有限二进制串域上的函数分支；自然数参数按 [[43-df-pair-coding]] 的 $\\operatorname{bin}$ 编码。 部分可计算性见 [[43-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Computable}$ 采用 [[43-df-computable]] 的同名符号。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"C,K:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Computable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\mathrm{Computable}(C)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Computable}(K).","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"C(n)+O(1)","display":false},{"tex":"K(n)+O(1)=O(\\log n)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":1613,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-126","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-kolm-uncomp]] — Incomputability of C and K"}],"outgoing":["a0589ee7a1cc12e8","6cd902d852c2c848","f357216a7edb035a","e039afac1517f3d7"]}